# Build context for site images (templates/ai-site/Dockerfile, sites/*/Dockerfile): source and lockfile only.
# Secrets must never reach an image: every .env file is excluded, examples aside.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.dev.vars
**/.dev.vars.*

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.output
**/.preview
**/.wrangler
**/.tanstack
**/.data
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/src/paraglide
**/routeTree.gen.ts
.git
.tmp
.claude
**/private-assets
